                 "and most happening place in Viridian.\f"
                 "We’re open to Trainers only.\r"
                 "You can battle against the best\n"
                 "of the best right downstairs.")
    end
}

script scr_seq_T02R0301_001 {
    simplenpcmsg("Viridian is the town closest to\n"
                 "Indigo Plateau.\r"
                 "They built this place because so\n"
                 "many Trainers pass through on their\f"
                 "way up to Indigo Plateau.")
    end
}

script scr_seq_T02R0301_002 {
    simplenpcmsg("They hold practice battles\n"
                 "downstairs here.\r"
                 "I would love to see how well a\n"
                 "Trainer from Johto battles.")
    end
}

script scr_seq_T02R0301_003 {
    simplenpcmsg("You go all over the place and battle\n"
                 "all kinds of Trainers.\r"
                 "This is not just to train your Pokémon.\n"
                 "This is also a chance to experience\f"
                 "many things yourself.\r"
                 "I bet the Champion from\n"
                 "Pallet Town went to all the\f"
                 "cities and towns in Kanto.")
    end
}

script scr_seq_T02R0301_004 {
    simplenpcmsg("Whew...\r"
                 "I’m taking a rest from\n"
                 "Pokémon battles.")
    end
}

